# VulneraSafe AI — environment variables for data ingestion.
# Copy this file to `.env` (which is git-ignored) and fill in values as needed.
# None of these are committed. The pipeline reads them from the process
# environment; absent keys cause the affected source to be SKIPPED with a
# recorded provenance gap, never a crash (Req 2.3, 3.7, 4.6).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOAA — OPTIONAL.
# The default NOAA ingester uses the NCEI Access Data Service, which is
# TOKEN-FREE and needs nothing here. Set NOAA_TOKEN only if you want to use the
# optional CDO v2 API path instead.
# Request a free token: https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/cdo-web/token
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOAA_TOKEN=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# US Census ACS — REQUIRED for real ACS queries.
# Without a key the ACS endpoint returns a "Missing Key" HTML page, so the
# ingester SKIPS ACS and records a gap with manual instructions.
# Sign up for a free key (instant email): https://api.census.gov/data/key_signup.html
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
CENSUS_API_KEY=
